  "description": "Ride up and down mountains - all day, every day.\nThis is arguably one of the most versatile bike in our range. For many riders this alloy beauty could be the one bike they will ever need. It sits right in the middle of categories and can be used for anything from long distance rides to fun days out at the bike park. It's big wheels, 140mm rear travel with 150mm fork and dialed in geometry defines this bike's donwhill and uphill capabilities. the frame’s unique semi-internal cable routing is a solution that is elegant and easy to service. Large, sealed pivots guarantee long periods of smooth, service free function. Do it all machine that will bring a smile on every riders face.\nAs the do-it-all machine it has everything you need to have fun on the bike!\n- 150F/140R travel\n- 2x29\" wheels\n- 4-piston brakes\n- 1x12 drivetrain\nFox Performance suspension Sturdy GX Eagle derailleur SRAM G2 4-piston brakes Race Face Aeffect R seatpost 65° Head Tube Angle 76° Effective Seat Tube Angle",
